        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "あわせて さんびゃくろくじゅうにん　よんたい、ただし いったい きゅうじゅうにん"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Total: 360 men; four companies, note, 90 men to a company. Both figures reconcile with the preceding column: 12 platoons x 30 = 360 and 4 companies x 90 = 360, so the same force is stated in two groupings. The total covers the 兵隊 only, not the 遊兵隊 in the next column left."
      },
